WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.083
(soft ambient music)

00:00:05.136 --> 00:00:06.541
- All right, it's 13 minutes.

00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:08.705
At 15, I say we leave.

00:00:08.705 --> 00:00:11.742
Sign in.
- Facts, facts, yeah.

00:00:11.742 --> 00:00:12.822
- Hello, I'm sorry I'm late.

00:00:12.822 --> 00:00:15.072
That'll never happen again.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.286
Okay, welcome back

00:00:19.286 --> 00:00:21.989
to another year at this
illustrious institution.

00:00:21.989 --> 00:00:23.819
As you know, being at a
historically black college

00:00:23.819 --> 00:00:26.445
and university is a lot like
being surrounded by family.

00:00:26.445 --> 00:00:27.716
So I should say welcome home.

00:00:27.716 --> 00:00:29.691
Let's get started with roll, shall we?

00:00:29.691 --> 00:00:30.585
Simone Fisk?

00:00:30.585 --> 00:00:33.534
- From Nashville, Tennessee,
music management major.

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:35.451
(ding)

00:00:37.744 --> 00:00:40.613
By the way, $30 bottles, XXX, anyone?

00:00:40.613 --> 00:00:43.067
Ladies free until 11, but you know,

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:44.035
doors open at 12.

00:00:44.035 --> 00:00:45.573
- Alright, that's enough.

00:00:45.573 --> 00:00:46.829
Do we have Janette Spellmen here?

00:00:46.829 --> 00:00:48.121
- I'm from Atlanta, Georgia.

00:00:48.121 --> 00:00:50.038
(ding)

00:00:52.748 --> 00:00:54.677
I know some of you may not recognize me,

00:00:54.677 --> 00:00:56.518
but over the break I
decided to cut my hair.

00:00:56.518 --> 00:00:58.865
So now, you know, I'm team natural.

00:00:58.865 --> 00:01:01.112
- Oh, my God, I love your texture.

00:01:01.112 --> 00:01:01.945
What do you put in it?

00:01:01.945 --> 00:01:04.195
- Girl, I use a growth oil,

00:01:05.152 --> 00:01:07.163
coconut styler,

00:01:07.163 --> 00:01:09.275
and I use a blueberry pomade for my edges.

00:01:09.275 --> 00:01:10.692
- Marcus Gramley?

00:01:12.296 --> 00:01:13.661
Okay.

00:01:13.661 --> 00:01:14.494
No Marcus.

00:01:14.494 --> 00:01:16.411
(ding)

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.608
Welcome to class.

00:01:24.608 --> 00:01:25.553
You're late, what's your name?

00:01:25.553 --> 00:01:27.948
- Meckenzie Howard, but I go by Mecka.

00:01:27.948 --> 00:01:29.044
- Could you give us your into.

00:01:29.044 --> 00:01:31.731
- I'm a fashion major
with a minor in marketing.

00:01:31.731 --> 00:01:33.648
(ding)

00:01:36.127 --> 00:01:37.398
And I'm from DC.

00:01:37.398 --> 00:01:40.178
Oh, and something about me...

00:01:40.178 --> 00:01:44.556
Oh, I modeled in New York
Fashion Week recently.

00:01:44.556 --> 00:01:46.511
- Okay, Mecka, please put your phone away.

00:01:46.511 --> 00:01:47.344
Who do we have next?

00:01:47.344 --> 00:01:49.344
We have a Michael Dillard?

00:01:49.344 --> 00:01:51.798
- My name is Michael X,
Dillard is my slave name.

00:01:51.798 --> 00:01:53.715
(ding)

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.342
- X is a good, strong last name.

00:01:58.342 --> 00:01:59.464
Just spelled "X?"

00:01:59.464 --> 00:02:01.286
Just "X," "EX," or...?

00:02:01.286 --> 00:02:02.690
X, okay, cool, great.

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:04.539
And who do we have?

00:02:04.539 --> 00:02:06.175
Oh, Mr. Cookman, welcome back.

00:02:06.175 --> 00:02:07.683
Good to see you again.

00:02:07.683 --> 00:02:09.417
We're gonna get through it this time.

00:02:09.417 --> 00:02:10.374
- Hey, Professor Hamsen.

00:02:10.374 --> 00:02:12.291
(ding)

00:02:16.529 --> 00:02:19.809
- Alright, so as you
know, the syllabus reads

00:02:19.809 --> 00:02:20.773
that we start at Chapter 11,

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:22.712
'cause I know everybody got
the syllabus and read it.

00:02:22.712 --> 00:02:24.629
(ding)

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:28.205
So, what's gonna happen is,

00:02:28.205 --> 00:02:29.292
we're gonna have a test every week,

00:02:29.292 --> 00:02:31.910
a paper every week,
keep those skills sharp.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:33.642
Let's begin, any questions?

00:02:33.642 --> 00:02:35.245
Good, I don't like questions.

00:02:35.245 --> 00:02:36.078
Let's go.

00:02:36.078 --> 00:02:39.161
(soft ambient music)

